<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Dear Neighbors,</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">On behalf of Mayor Andrew J. Ginther, City Council President Shannon G. Hardin and Columbus State Community College President Dr. David Harrison, you are formally invited to an event featuring Dr. Jill Biden, First Lady of the United States. Featured panelists will be discussing Columbus’ participation in President Biden’s Investing in America Workforce Initiatives.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">The event will take place tomorrow, July 12, in City Council Chambers at Columbus City Hall. You will need to arrive at City Hall by 12:00 p.m. at the latest.  <strong>Please plan on arriving early to park and go through security, entry is from 12:00 p.m.- 1:00 p.m.; no visitors will be allowed access to the event after 1:00 p.m. Late arrivals will not be admitted.</strong> </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Note:  This invitation is intended only for the person receiving this email, and is non-transferrable. Only invited persons will be granted access to the event. You can RSVP at <a href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/forms.gle/DAWiYduLf12Hoq648?%21%21J-4R7rTSYA%21bvdWKR8XJEbrOsCaAT3jcnW3EKz_LPoITFrQUUuEP5qtqQY5TB3iSNh9oDZd9rvmYKhwzRn9V2mV0OCd8mpM2HIzgcJFWcFnXQ%24=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://forms.gle/DAWiYduLf12Hoq648</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We look forward to seeing you on Wednesday afternoon.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">*Please see below for official instructions from the White House.</p>
